cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ACC-Optimization"
type: software
version: "1.0.0-srep"
license: "GPL-3.0-only"
abstract: >-
  Research software for adaptive cruise control optimization, metaheuristic
  benchmarking, and reproducible simulation experiments. The framework
  evaluates GA, PSO, KMA, SKA, and HOA under IAE, ISE, ITAE, and ITSE
  objective functions, with assessment based on optimization quality,
  inter-run stability, convergence behavior, computational efficiency,
  and control-performance validation.
